@startuml
!include common-theme.puml
title 单件模式：全局共享配置与客户端实例

class Settings <<Singleton>> {
  +project_name
  +api_v1_prefix
  +database_url
  +secret_key
}

class SessionFactory <<Singleton>> {
  +engine
  +SessionLocal
}

class HttpClient <<Singleton>> {
  +baseURL
  +requestInterceptor()
  +responseInterceptor()
}

class AuthStore <<Singleton>> {
  +token
  +user
  +setSession()
  +clearSession()
}

class FastAPIApp
class FrontendViews

FastAPIApp --> Settings
FastAPIApp --> SessionFactory
FrontendViews --> HttpClient
FrontendViews --> AuthStore

note bottom of Settings
后端实际以模块级 `settings` 暴露唯一配置对象。
end note

note bottom of HttpClient
前端实际通过 `axios.create()` 导出唯一 http 实例。
end note
@enduml
